  "text": "At two a.m., Maya finally finds the job she wants. She fills in the application on her phone: her name, her experience, and one honest line about why. She presses Submit. Sent. In less than a second, her application crosses the city and lands in the company's hiring system. The next morning, Daniel, the recruiter, opens it and reads every word. That one honest line? It's the reason her phone rings.",
